UC1 ..> UC10 : <<extend>>
UC6 ..> UC7 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC2 : <<extend>>
UC6 ..> UC14 : <<extend>>
UC6 ..> UC15 : <<extend>>
UC6 ..> UC13 : <<extend>>
UC7 ..> UC16 : <<extend>>
UC2 ..> UC3 : <<extend>>
UC2 ..> UC4 : <<extend>>
UC2 ..> UC12 : <<include>>
UC14 ..> UC12 : <<include>>
UC15 ..> UC12 : <<include>>
UC16 ..> UC12 : <<include>>
UC8 ..> UC9 : <<include>>

' ===== NOTES =====
note bottom of UC5 : Under Development
note bottom of UC11 : Under Development
note bottom of UC16 : Under Development

@enduml
